##api


##Signup
GET http://localhost:8181/admin/auth/register-admin
content-type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "",
  "lastName": "",
  "email": "",
  "password": "",
  "confirmPassword": ""
}
###                                     

##login
POST http://localhost:8181/admin/login
content-type: application/json

{
  "email": "",
  "password": "",
  "rememberMe": ""
}
###

##profile
GET http://localhost:8181/admin/me
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.data.token}}
###

##forgot
GET http://localhost:8181/admin/auth/forgot-password
content-type: application/json

{
  "email": ""
}
###